comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-16T22:25:26.735Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-17: searched all statuses for linked test output buffer, max_buffer, stdout write, UNKNOWN write, EAGAIN, verbose child, and coverage capture. Closed pm-j36ypd and pm-5sm91o own two previously shipped EAGAIN fixes; their own lineage treats a released-version recurrence with contradictory evidence as a distinct child issue. Open pm-e97jyf covers schema-context divergence, not output transport. This item records the new UNKNOWN SyncWriteStream recurrence without reopening completed historical fixes."
body: ""
